## Integration Guide

### Basic Setup

```html
<!-- 1. Include Cartique CSS -->
<link rel="stylesheet" href="cartique.css">

<!-- 2. Add Container -->
<div id="cartique"></div>

<!-- 3. Include Components Template -->
<template id="cartique-components">
    <!-- Cartique HTML components -->
</template>

<!-- 4. Include Cartique JS -->
<script src="cartique.js"></script>
```

### Initialization

```javascript
// Initialize with product data
const cartique = new Cartique(
    products,                    // Array of product objects
    {                            // Features configuration
        grid: true,
        pagination: true,
        columns: 3,
        sidebar: true,
        search: true,
        sorting: true,
        theme: 'light',
        themeColor: '#2a2a2a',
        containerId: 'cartique',
        checkoutUrl: '/checkout',
        currencySymbol: 'R'
    },
    {                            // Callbacks
        onReviewSubmit: handleReviewSubmit,
        onCheckout: handleCheckout,
        onAddToCart: handleAddToCart
    }
);
```

