## Extension Points

### 1. **Callback System**
```javascript
{
    onReviewSubmit: async ({ productId, rating, comment, onSuccess, onError }) => {
        // Custom review submission logic
        const result = await api.submitReview({ productId, rating, comment });
        if (result.success) {
            onSuccess(result);
        } else {
            onError(result.error);
        }
    }
}
```

### 2. **Custom Product Rendering**
